    "The univariate exploration reveals five core structural characteristics of the NYC municipal payroll universe:\n",
    "1. **High Skewness of Primary Variable:** Total Overtime Paid exhibits extreme zero-inflation (72.64% zero mass) and right-tail skewness (peaking at $527,532.01). While the citywide median is $0.00, positive overtime recipients average $13,817.78.\n",
    "2. **Bimodal Physical Hours Allocation:** Overtime hours reflect a parallel zero mass (75.12% zero hours), but active overtime workers log a median of 200 hours, with a severe fatigue cohort of 3,469 records logging >1,500 hours.\n",
