    "4. **Unit Segmentation Imperative:** Base salaries cannot be evaluated collectively; `Per Annum` median ($75,974.00) must be analyzed separately from daily and hourly schedules.\n",
    "5. **Organizational Dominance:** Education (27.4%) and Police (10.7%) dominate headcount volume, while Manhattan houses 66.2% of administrative work locations.\n"
